== Notes ==

* It's recommended that you be immediately ready to find and kill Duster X after handing Drekon the [[Daily Log]] as that is the only trigger to spawn the Clockwork.
* Guide Clockworks throughout Ak'Anon will kill steal if you attack the Duster Clockworks too near to them.
* There are no faction changes for killing either Duster V, Duster X, or Cleaner X.
* Killing Scrubber IV results in the following faction hit:
<div class="facblock">
* Your faction with [[Dark Reflection]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Eldritch Collective]] got worse.
* Your faction with [[Gem Choppers]] got worse.
* Your faction with [[King AkAnon]] got worse.
* Your faction with [[Meldrath]] got better.
</div>
* Yes, Drekon refers to Sanfyrd Featherhead as Sanfyrd Montop in his quest dialog.
